Einhell is dedicated to providing you with a tool set for all your DIY-requests. The Einhell TeTK 18/35 Battery Kit comes with the 18/35 Cordless Impact Drill/Driver, a High-Performance Li-ion 2X Battery, and an 18V Charger. The power-packed machine driver features a powerful 2-speed gearbox and brushless motor for optimal energy efficiency. The machine driver uses a 1.2Ah Li-ion battery that delivers 4.8 Ah of power every hour, and it has a lithium aluminium hydride battery cell that can be charged and discharged up to 1,200 times. The brushless impact drill/driver Einhell TE-CD 18/35 Li comes in a brushed metal case that looks great on both the countertop and workspace. This drill model is suitable for professional and DIY work and also meets the requirements of the European harmonized standard EN60309. The drill comes equipped with a quick-release X bit holder with a detachable keyless chuck for easy access to various types of bits. Einhell TE-CD 18/35 Li Cordless Impact Drill/Driver Kit is available in silver or black.
